  /// pending-wait paths and the shutdown flush. Returns whether the
  /// snapshot LANDED (false: coalesced, deduped, empty, or failed).
  Future<bool> _appendObligationsSnapshot(
    Session session,
    List<Map<String, Object?>> payload, {
